title: The August plenum
subtitle: The Central Committee of the Russian party takes up Lenin's notes.
new-page: true
tags: kpd_event
view-if: year = 1923 and month = 8 and test_stage = 2 and testament_path >= 1 and testament_path <= 3 and y23_testament_plenum_done = 0
